  "details": "I forget what they're called - the side panels.\nIt used to save the fact that I keep my avatar menu open, and on the \"last updated\" and \"uploaded avatars\" options.\nNow it keeps resetting to a default every time I log in.\nVarious pages in the main menu itself could do with saving where I'm at, or different defaults.\nThe world menu defaults to having the \"My Worlds\" category minimized - where I'd prefer that to be the main thing I access there. It resets all the time.\nThere are probably more examples, but there is so much stuff in the new menu it's hard for me to think of all of them.",
